{"seq":3,"slug":"flavor-texture","title":"风味与质地","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flavor-release","title":"风味释放机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/flavor-release","wordCount":2407,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"texture-modification","title":"质地改造","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/texture-modification","wordCount":2558,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"sensory-illusion","title":"感官欺骗与错觉","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/flavor-texture/sensory-illusion","wordCount":3054,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"风味与质地\">风味与质地</h1><p>烹饪的终极目标是愉悦感官，而分子料理为这一目标提供了前所未有的精确控制手段。本章从三个层面展开：风味释放机制探讨香气分子如何从食物基质中逃逸并被感知，质地改造研究如何通过水胶体和乳化剂设计出从脆到弹、从稀到稠的连续质地谱，感官欺骗与错觉则揭示视觉、听觉、触觉如何系统性地影响我们对味道的判断。这一章的内容既是前两章科学与技术的应用延伸，也为第四章的工具实践提供了设计目标。</p>\n"}